      "date": "2026-08-11 00:04:38.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 1:\n\n#### The following sessions will be run for Build 129080 (patch #1):\n\n#### Enforced:\n\n- review-ldiskfs-dne on el8.10-x86_64/el8.10-x86_64/ldiskfs/ldiskfs\n\n- review-ldiskfs-dne on el9.7-x86_64/el9.7-x86_64/ldiskfs/ldiskfs\n\n- review-ldiskfs-dne-arm on el8.10-x86_64/rocky9.5-aarch64/ldiskfs/ldiskfs\n\n#### Optional:\n\n- review-ldiskfs-dne on el10.1-x86_64/el10.1-x86_64/ldiskfs/ldiskfs\n\n---\n\nMaloo Test Queue: https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_queue?jobs=lustre-reviews&builds=129080&commit=Apply+Filter\n\nMaloo Results: https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/related?jobs=lustre-reviews&builds=129080#redirect",
